        "Each recitation is shown in Arabic with a reading aid and its meaning. Learn the correct pronunciation from a qualified reciter." to "Kila kisomo kinaonyeshwa kwa Kiarabu na kifaa cha kusoma na maana yake. Jifunze matamshi sahihi kutoka kwa msomaji aliyehitimu.",
        "The rulings every worshipper should know. Tap a topic to read it." to "Hukumu kila mwenye kuabudu anapaswa kujua. Gusa mada ili kuisoma.",
